[00:23.23]1. Nations align as one,
[00:28.03]Opposing Jehovah’s Son.
[00:31.03]Their time of human rulership
[00:36.03]By God’s decree now is done.
[00:41.03]Rulers have had their day;
[00:45.03]God’s Kingdom is here to stay.
[00:49.03]Soon Christ will crush earthly enemies.
[00:54.03]No more will there be delay.
[01:34.78](Chorus)
[02:15.53]Seek God for your deliverance,
[02:20.03]Yes, look to him with confidence.
[02:24.67]Seek his righteousness,
[02:26.90]Show your faithfulness,
[02:29.13]For his sov’reignty, take your stand.
[02:33.63]Then see our God deliver you
[02:38.23]By his mighty hand.
[02:39.63]2. People on earth now choose,
[02:41.03]Responding to this good news.
[02:42.43]We offer to all men the choice
[02:43.83]To hear or proudly refuse.
[02:45.23]Trials, although severe,
[02:46.63]Need not fill our hearts with fear.
[02:48.04]Jehovah cares for his loyal ones;
[02:49.44]Our cries for help he will hear.
[02:50.84](Chorus)
[02:52.24]Seek God for your deliverance,
[02:53.64]Yes, look to him with confidence.
[02:55.04]Seek his righteousness,
[02:56.44]Show your faithfulness,
[02:57.84]For his sov’reignty, take your stand.
[03:02.68]Then see our God deliver you
[03:07.92]By his mighty hand.